2 roll 4 2 roll curveto } repeat 6 2 roll 4 2 roll ArrowB curveto }
ifelse } def
/ClosedBezier { BezierNArray n 1 eq { pop pop } { moveto n 1 sub 3 idiv {
6 2 roll 4 2 roll curveto } repeat closepath } ifelse } def
